sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Vue/Inertia UI
  participant Router as Laravel web router
  participant Middleware as Web/session/auth middleware
  participant Controller
  participant DB as Eloquent/database
  UI->>Router: GET/POST/PATCH/DELETE web request
  Router->>Middleware: Session, CSRF, auth and verified checks
  Middleware-->>UI: Redirect/reject if blocked
  Middleware->>Controller: Continue permitted request
  Controller->>DB: Read or persist validated data
  DB-->>Controller: Result
  Controller-->>UI: Inertia page props or redirect/validation errors
  Note over UI,Controller: No standalone routes/api.php or REST/OpenAPI contract is currently present.
